      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:6:7:18:9",
      "text": [
        " كَتَبْتُ إِلَى أَبِي الْحَسَنِ ( عليه السلام ) أَسْأَلُهُ عَنْ شَارِبِ الْمُسْكِرِ قَالَ فَكَتَبَ ( عليه السلام ) شَارِبُ الْخَمْرِ كَافِرٌ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "A number of our companions, from Sahl Bin Ziyad and Yaqoub Bin Yazeed, from Muhammad Bin Dazawayi who said,",
          "‘I wrote to Abu Al-Hassan<sup>asws</sup>, asking him<sup>asws</sup> about the wine drinker. So he<sup>asws</sup> wrote: ‘The wine drinker is an Infidel’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "9. A number of our people have narrated from Sahl ibn Ziyad and Ya’qub ibn Yazid from Muhammad ibn Dadhawayh who has said the following: “I once wrote to abu al-Hassan, asking him (the Imam) about drinking intoxicating liquor. He (the Imam) wrote back in answer, ‘A wine drinker is an unbeliever.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
